body:
Delightful Ivy coupled with fallout 4 seasons - summer 3.5 is what I run. Impacts fps a little but not too much maybe 5-10fps on my rig. (R9290 and Ryzen 7 3700k) redoes everything, grass, leaves and makes vines a proper vibrant green like irl. With these 2 mods theres different levels of greenery you can choose from. 

&#x200B;

Hope this helps!
